        },
        "description": "**Ki kore:** Mess settings bodlay. Sob field optional — jeta pathabe shudhu seta bodlabe.\n\n**Ke parbe:** OWNER ba MANAGER. Cook/Member cheshta korle `403`.\n\n**Audit:** age-pore-r snapshot audit log-e jay — \"10 · Audit Log\" folder-e dekha jabe.\n\n**Expect:** `200`",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"mealCutoffTime\": \"21:30\",\n  \"cutoffDaysAhead\": 2\n}",
